# data (prices: legacy_v1/data/fetch_prices.py) and results are not tracked; anchored to the repo root so the
# legacy_v1/data/ code package is not caught. Tracked: data/universe (screening lists read by production_config),
# data/params (GA rule parameters v1, save_ga_params.py) and data/params_v2 (rules v2, save_ga_params.py --rules v2).
/data/*
!/data/universe/
!/data/params/
!/data/params_v2/
/results/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/
